SUMMARY: THURSDAY (Free event) The Challenges of Modern Dating and Modern 
 Relationships 
DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\nHello everyone\,\n
 \n(Free Online Event)\n\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\n\n**The Chal
 lenges of Modern Dating and Modern Relationships** is a one-hour interacti
 ve Zoom discussion hosted and moderated by **Steve Flemming** through the 
 **Soul City Social Club**. Together we'll explore the realities of dating 
 and relationships in today's fast-changing world—communication\, trust\,
  expectations\, loneliness\, technology\, emotional connection\, and what 
 it really takes to build healthy\, lasting relationships. Whether you're s
 ingle\, dating\, married\, separated\, or simply interested in understandi
 ng the modern relationship landscape\, you're welcome to join this respect
 ful\, open-minded conversation. Come to share your experiences\, listen to
  others\, and leave with fresh perspectives in a friendly\, supportive\, a
 nd judgment-free environment.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\nArrival Time:\nPlease join us between 
 8:00 pm and 8:10 pm (if you can)\nThe conversation begins right away :)\n\
 n***\n\nCamera's On Please :)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\nSoul City Socia
 l Club\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@SteveFl
 emmingSongs/videos\n\n\\*If you do wish to support and contribute to this 
 and these Thursday Night online events that include 3 plus hours of music 
 after\; you can do so through e transfer or pay pal to steveflemming11@gma
 il.com\nYou're support and gratitude is greatly appreciated!\n\n**Zoom lin
 k:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n**Bonus:**\n**Stick around after th
 e event for Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart**\nCanadian Folk and
  Country Artist\nhttps://www.meetup.com/soulcity/events/315427766/
