SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart (July 9th) 
DESCRIPTION:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart!\nHello everyone\,\n
 \nPlease join us for an inspiring and soulful experience with **Songs with
  Heart!**\n\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\, nature\, the fut
 ure\, the past\, the present\, spirituality and the search for meaning in 
 life :)\n\nCheck out one or more of my songs here too :)\nhttps://youtu.be
 /vei1PDucWoM?si=fHuM7nH3qBaDzi5c\n\nDo you appreciate?\n\n* Thoughtful son
 gwriting\n* Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n* Life reflec
 tion and meaningful lyrics\n* Songs that help you understand yourself bett
 er\n\nIf so\, you have come to the right place :)\n\nThese are songs about
  ordinary people\, extraordinary moments\, beautiful imagery\, and the sea
 rch for what is real.\n\n\\*You are welcome to join us any time starting a
 t 9:00 pm (Eastern Time)\n\nEvent Details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve F
 lemming\n(Canadian Folk and Country Artist)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@Stev
 eFlemmingSongs\n\nEvent Details:\n**Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with He
 art (Thursday\, July 9th)**\n**(on Zoom)**\n\nSteve Flemming's songs explo
 re the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, imagination\, 
 and heartfelt observation. Drawing from folk\, country\, rock\, blue eyed 
 soul\, and singer-songwriter traditions\, his work touches on themes of lo
 ve\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\, personal grow
 th\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning. His songs often feature me
 morable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical questions\, and a de
 ep curiosity about life and human nature. Whether telling a story\, sharin
 g a life lesson\, expressing a romantic sentiment\, or reflecting on the s
 tate of the world\, his music seeks to inspire thought\, connection\, comp
 assion\, and a greater appreciation for the journey we all share\n\n**Song
 s containing:**\n\n* Memorable characters\n* Emotional honesty\n* Genuine 
 craftsmanship\n\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nSteve Flemming is a prolific 
 folk-country songwriter\; whose songs explore ordinary people\, gratitude\
 , personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality\, and the search for meaning
 .\n\n**A little more about Steve the songwriter:**\nHis songs explore free
 dom\, awareness\, love\, consciousness\, and the simple wisdom hidden in o
 rdinary life.\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n\n**Pay What You 
 Can: (P.W.Y.C)**\nYou can kindly send through e transfer or pay pal to:\n*
 *steveflemming11@gmail.com**\n\n-Anything you can contribute is greatly ap
 preciated to help support these wonderful intimate evenings among music lo
 vers and friends\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Zoom link:**\nhttps://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928\n
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
