  Party after the Soccer game at 5:30 pm :)\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSin
 cerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**2026 FIF
 A World Cup Final Game Party! (with Food and Drink Specials) (Sunday\, Jul
 y 19th)**\n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food and the Worl
 d Cup Finals Party!\n-Amazing people\, resereved seating\, great food and 
