 \*Plenty of parking all around the venue\n-Free Parking on Mt. Pleasant no
 rth of Eglinton and -Free Parking on Eglinton (Just west of Mt. Pleasant)\
 n\\*Stick around after for the Patio Dinner party too :)\n\n**Friendly Rem
